					5.5.6
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b> of Time,
				<i>continue,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν θύραν ἐπεῖχε κρούων</span>”
